sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser (Next.js)
    participant G as GenerationController
    participant Ge as GenerationService
    participant JS as JobsService
    participant RQ as RabbitMQ (ai_generation)
    participant W as worker-ai consumer (concurrency 5)
    participant AI as OmniRoute<br/>POST /v1/chat/completions
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    B->>G: POST /content/generate {materialId, operation}
    G->>Ge: validate scope (material READY, dedup key)
    Ge->>JS: issueJob(type = AI_GENERATE_*)
    JS->>DB: INSERT jobs (status = 'queued')
    JS->>RQ: publish {jobId, instituteId, type, payload}
    RQ-->>JS: ack
    JS-->>Ge: job record
    Ge-->>B: 202 ACCEPTED {jobId} (async, API never blocks)

    loop Client polls
        B->>G: GET jobs/:id (status)
        G->>DB: SELECT job
        DB-->>G: status
        G-->>B: queued | processing | completed | failed
    end

    RQ->>W: deliver message (prefetch)
    W->>DB: jobs → processing
    W->>DB: resolve READY source materials, build context chunks
    loop Each context chunk
        W->>AI: POST /chat/completions (temperature 0.2)
        AI-->>W: raw JSON response
    end
    W->>W: parse + Pydantic schema validate (per type)
    W->>W: aggregate + deterministic dedup
    W->>DB: persist content_items / questions (AI_GENERATED + provenance)
    W->>DB: jobs → completed (completedAt)
    Note over W,DB: Failure: transient responses/transport errors retried with backoff (max 3),<br/>terminal error → job failed, never left processing.